  "body": "Currently the only way to get the first message sent in a room is to parse backwards from a topological token returned by `get_room_events_max_id` - there is no sufficient Pagination Config to obtain the first message if the topological token for the first message is not known (I guess handcrafting a `from_token` from a presumed `topological_ordering=1` might work, but is also subject to break at any time, being solely an internal detail ? ) ",
